<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 bln Ecu-into-euro April 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 bln Ecu-into-euro April 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Paribas and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.0 BLN ECU   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+2-4 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED.</p>
<p>	     *NOTES MAY BE REDENOMINATED IN EUROS FROM 01.JAN.99.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
